  skos:description "A Software Quality Widget is a badge or widget that communicates the certification level or status of a software product. It provides a visual indicator of quality or compliance standing, enabling users to quickly assess a product's certification at a glance."@en ;
  schema:category "Trust|Certification|Software Development Quality|List of Certifications: Software Quality|Software Quality Widget" ;
